<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos 1996 net at 310 million pesos.</title>
<headline>Cosmos 1996 net at 310 million pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmos Food Corp, the beverage unit of RFM Corp, posted earnings of 310 million pesos in 1996.</p>
<p>RFM Corp also said in a statement on Thursday that its beverage arm was targeting a 480 million peso net income for 1997.  </p>
<p>RFM said the 480 million peso projected earnings of Cosmos will make it RFM's biggest source of income for 1997.</p>
<p>In 1995, Cosmos made 143.8 million in net income with revenues of 1.217 billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
